information_on_the_npc = text "Information on the NPC buff payment|- It is free for a customer who is at the level between Lv. 1 and 35..|- The three types of buffs, enhancement of striking power, enhancement of defensive power and enhancement of physical strength, are provided for 30 minutes.|- The buff provided varies depending on the degree of level and the money to be paid also varies.|- The three types of buffs can be overlaid with each other and as for the buff that has already been received, it can't be received again unless the time has expired or cancelled."
please_select_the_buff = text "Please select the buff you would like to receive.|# Shout for charge : Attack power 10%|# Firm will: Defensive power 100|# Endless patience: Enhancement of physical strength by 500"
please_select_your_method = text "Please select your method of payment. |#Noah : 30000 Noah consumed |# sign of victory : Two used"
